5,1,1,talk,May,,I’m tired of reinventing the wheel. Let’s check what actually happened last time.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Benjamin,,We can’t promise service if the crews don’t exist. I need to see the staffing reality.,"{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
7,1,1,talk,Midori,,"Crowding complaints are loud, but are they true? I want to verify the actual wait times.","{""words"":16,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
8,1,1,talk,Shizue,,I worry about hidden delays. Who else has to approve these plans?,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Jonathan,,"I just want to know what the long-term costs really are, not just the headline.","{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
10,1,2,talk,May,,"Agreed, Shizue. History is a good teacher.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Shizue""],""raw_differs"":false}"
11,1,2,talk,Benjamin,,"@Midori, if the waits are short, maybe the problem is elsewhere.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
12,1,2,talk,Midori,,"@Benjamin, exactly. We need data, not anecdotes.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[""Benjamin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
13,1,2,talk,Shizue,,I will look into the approval processes and past completion records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,1,2,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll focus on the financial commitments and the ticketing fees.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,1,3,talk,May,,I’ll check the old pilots and the journey audits.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
16,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,I’ll look at the roster books and the crew establishment.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
17,1,3,talk,Midori,,I’ll investigate the timed runs and the journey audits.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Shizue,,I’ll check the joint operators' minutes and the contingency pricing.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Jonathan,,I’ll review the capital ledger and the ticketing contractor fees.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
20,1,4,talk,May,,Let’s see what the dust reveals.,"{""words"":6,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
21,1,4,talk,Benjamin,,"Logic over emotion, please.","{""words"":4,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
22,1,4,talk,Midori,,I hope the numbers tell the truth.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
23,1,4,talk,Shizue,,Peace of mind comes from knowing the ground is solid.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
24,1,4,talk,Jonathan,,"Quietly, I hope the books balance out.","{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
